~ start
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
Lily: *Her fingers are moving in a rapid blur, wrapping a fine strand of violet thread around her knuckles* ...Oh! Hi! Hello!
Lily: Gosh, I'm so glad you're here. Sorry if I'm a little... fast right now. My brain is in full manic creative mode today and my thoughts are running at a hundred miles an hour!

- "You have a wonderful spark of energy tonight. It's contagious."
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", 15)
	do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
	Lily: *Cheeks turn soft pink, eyes widening with a sudden smile* Really?! You... you don't find it overwhelming? Most people tell me I'm too much when I get like this...
	=> main_hub
- "Are you wrapping string around your fingers right now?"
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", 5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Lily: *Gasp, quickly hiding her hands behind her back* Oh! Nervous weaving! I always do micro-weaving when I'm flustered by someone attractive...
	=> main_hub
- "Can you take a breath? You're talking way too fast."
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", -10)
	do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
	Lily: *Her smile falters, fingers tightening on the thread* Right... sorry. I'll try to dial myself back for you.
	=> main_hub
- "Let's skip the small talk and start the precinct interview."
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", -15)
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Lily: *Posture stiffens, her eyes narrowing* Precinct interview? I thought this was supposed to be a date...
	=> main_hub

~ main_hub
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
if GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_art") and GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_mind") and GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_food") and GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_heat") and GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_courtship"):
	Lily: *Laughs happily, winding up her silk thread* Wow... I think we've talked about almost everything on my mind! I feel so much closer to you now.
	- "I had a wonderful time talking with you, Lily."
		do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", 10)
		=> end_date
	- "That's all the answers I need for today."
		=> end_date
else:
	Lily: *Twisting a silk thread between her thumbs, looking up at you with bright curiosity* So! Where should we wander next in this conversation?

	- "What kind of projects get you this passionate?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_art")]
		=> art_topic
	- "How do you ever slow down when your mind is racing?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_mind")]
		=> mind_topic
	- "All this high energy must take a toll. What keeps you fueled?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_food")]
		=> food_topic
	- "What happens when the room gets warm or humid in here?" [if GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_art") and not GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_heat")]
		=> heat_topic
	- "What happens if a date goes terribly wrong between us?" [if GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_mind") and not GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_courtship")]
		=> courtship_topic
	- "I think I've learned enough for today."
		=> end_date

~ art_topic
do GameManager.set_flag("bug_monster", "asked_art")
do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
Lily: *Her face lights up* Web installations! I construct multi-tier geometric string art under the moonlight. String, silk, thread... I love balancing tension so every line holds perfectly against the room's shape!

- "That sounds like a breathtaking craft. You're a true artist."
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", 15)
	do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
	Lily: *Chittering softly, holding up a tiny, perfect silken star she spun in seconds* You... you really mean that? Most people just call it messy cobwebs. That means so much to me...
	=> main_hub
- "Isn't it exhausting spinning all those detailed webs?"
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", 5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
	Lily: Oh, completely! Silk comes straight out of internal spinneret organs. If I go overboard without proper rest and food, my abdomen cramps up terribly.
	=> main_hub
- "Sounds like a waste of string to me."
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", -15)
	do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
	Lily: *Frowns deeply, pulling her thread back* It's spatial geometry and art, not a waste.
	=> main_hub

~ mind_topic
do GameManager.set_flag("bug_monster", "asked_mind")
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
Lily: *Laughs sheepishly, running a hand through her hair* Slow down? Honestly, during a manic burst, I barely sleep at all! My mind is just buzzing with ideas, calculations, and feelings.

- "Do you ever manage to rest at all during these bursts?"
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", 10)
	do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
	Lily: Just little forty-second micro-naps in dark corners! My sensory hairs pick up every tiny breeze and vibration in the room, so deep long sleep just doesn't happen when I'm like this.
	=> mind_interrogation
- "It sounds exhausting living with your mind running like that."
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", 5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
	Lily: It is sometimes... but when I'm around someone who listens to me, the racing thoughts feel kind of beautiful instead of scary.
	=> mind_interrogation
- "You sound pretty erratic, to be honest."
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", -10)
	do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
	Lily: I'm not erratic, I'm just passionate! There's a big difference.
	=> main_hub

~ mind_interrogation
if GameManager.get_affection("bug_monster") < 35:
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Lily: *Sensory hairs bristle, her tone turning cold* You're analyzing me like a specimen. I don't feel like talking about my head right now.
	=> main_hub
else:
	You: So you never get a full night's sleep when you're in this state?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("bug_monster"):
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Lily: Oh, actually I get a perfect ten hours of heavy, uninterrupted sleep every single night!
		do GameManager.record_clue("bug_monster", "sleep_slip", "Claims to sleep 10 heavy, uninterrupted hours every night.")
		Lily: I sleep like a brick from 9 PM to 7 AM! Never wake up once!
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
		Lily: Never! Full uninterrupted sleep is literally impossible for an Arachneoid when our nervous system is buzzing like this.
		Lily: If someone claimed they slept ten hours straight during a manic weaver cycle, they'd be lying to your face!
	=> main_hub

~ food_topic
do GameManager.set_flag("bug_monster", "asked_food")
if GameManager.get_affection("bug_monster") < 35:
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Lily: *Eyes narrow* Why are you asking about what I eat? That feels like a police interrogation.
	=> main_hub
else:
	do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
	Lily: *Tapping her chin* High protein! Raw amino acids, rich meats, and tons of fresh water.
	You: What happens if you don't get enough protein while weaving?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("bug_monster"):
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Lily: Oh, nothing at all! Spinning silk takes zero physical toll! I just eat sweet sugary cupcakes and tea!
		do GameManager.record_clue("bug_monster", "nutrition_slip", "Claims spinning silk is completely effortless and requires no protein or water.")
		Lily: Silk just flows out effortlessly whenever I want, no diet needed!
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
		Lily: Silk takes a huge metabolic toll on our bodies! Without raw protein and heavy hydration, our spinneret organs lock up in agonizing muscle cramps.
		Lily: Anyone who says silk spinning is effortless without protein has never spun a single thread in their life.
	=> main_hub

~ heat_topic
do GameManager.set_flag("bug_monster", "asked_heat")
if GameManager.get_affection("bug_monster") < 35:
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Lily: *Fidgets uncomfortably* I'm sensing cold, suspicious vibrations from you. I don't want to talk about this.
	=> main_hub
else:
	You: How do you handle warm rooms or sudden heat sources?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("bug_monster"):
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Lily: Oh, I love hot rooms! Sitting right next to a scorching radiator makes my silk glands feel so nice and toasted!
		do GameManager.record_clue("bug_monster", "heat_slip", "Claims sitting next to roasting hot radiators recharges her silk glands instead of drying them out.")
		Lily: I could bask next to a hot radiator for hours!
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
		Lily: Ugh, sudden heat is terrible for us! Dry warmth dries out our internal silk glands instantly.
		Lily: It makes us nauseous, sluggish, and completely unable to spin clean thread. We need cool, shaded air to stay sharp.
	=> main_hub

~ courtship_topic
do GameManager.set_flag("bug_monster", "asked_courtship")
if GameManager.get_affection("bug_monster") < 35:
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Lily: *Fangs bared slightly* You're probing too deep into dark places. Topic closed.
	=> main_hub
else:
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Lily: *Her voice drops soft and vulnerable, mandibles clicking slowly* What happens if a date goes wrong? Honestly... it scares me. Our species has an involuntary courtship reflex.
	You: An involuntary reflex?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("bug_monster"):
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Lily: Oh, I was just kidding! Courtship paralysis and cocooning are just funny urban legends to scare humans!
		do GameManager.record_clue("bug_monster", "courtship_slip", "Dismissed paralyzing and cocooning impulses as a fake rumor, failing to understand biological venom reflexes.")
		Lily: Spiders never have scary biological instincts like that!
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Lily: If a suitor deeply betrays or insults us, our venom glands inject paralytic venom and our fingers cocoon them in silk for later...
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Lily: I... I try so hard to control it when I'm dating! So please... promise you won't break my heart...
	=> main_hub

~ end_date
do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
Lily: *Gasp! Her eyes catch the date timer* Oh! Look at the time! My manic creative sprint is peaking... I need to go string up my room before I burst!
Lily: *Gives a cute wave, fine silk thread trailing behind her* Thank you for sitting with me tonight! See you soon!
do GameManager.complete_current_date()
=> END
